attles, where every decision carries weight.\n\nUpgrades for your Tech-Priests include servo-skulls, support gear and other mechanical enhancements, and you pick from several character classes. Cognition points gate the strongest weapons and abilities. A single-player game from Bulwark Studios with full controller support, it suits strategy fans and Warhammer 40,000 followers who want a tactical campaign with a distinctive tech-cult flavor."}}